+
+- **FINDING STRENGTH: PASS.** §3.4 matches the archived data exactly. From [r2.json](</Users/tengjun/Desktop/ai4qkd (1)/AI4QKD/docs/findings/s2.3_device_imperfections_r2.json:176>), the incremental decomposition is:
