+
+- **PLAN ALIGNMENT: PASS.** The `≥1000`-point hard acceptance is closed: docs state `37 × 33 = 1221` in [§3.6](</Users/tengjun/Desktop/ai4qkd (1)/AI4QKD/docs/findings/s2.3_device_imperfections.md:115>), the test asserts it in [test_decoy_bb84_sweep.py](</Users/tengjun/Desktop/ai4qkd (1)/AI4QKD/tests/test_sweeps/test_decoy_bb84_sweep.py:111>), and JSON records `n_points = 1221` in [r2.json](</Users/tengjun/Desktop/ai4qkd (1)/AI4QKD/docs/findings/s2.3_device_imperfections_r2.json:214>). Caveat: that JSON field is metadata plus an envelope sample, not the full 1221-point dump.
