+- **SCOPE DISCIPLINE: FAIL.** Findings §4 is clean in [v0.2](</Users/tengjun/Desktop/ai4qkd (1)/AI4QKD/docs/findings/s2.3_device_imperfections.md:130>), but [PHASE1_LOG §3.5.2](</Users/tengjun/Desktop/ai4qkd (1)/AI4QKD/docs/PHASE1_LOG.md:121>) still contains residual plan-rewrite phrasing: `删除 v0.1 的 "建议修订 plan 阈值" 语`. If the bar is zero residual wording in the reviewed sections, this is not fully scrubbed.
